{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "MOFA 的输入描述允许相同或重叠的样本集，但并未定义任意缺失模态或样本对应关系的通用兼容性规则。",
      "basis": "CAUTION_CONTEXT",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "Given several data matrices with measurements of multiple -omics data types on the same or on overlapping sets of samples, MOFA infers an interpretable low-dimensional representation in terms of a few latent factors ."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的 cell_identity_link=none 表示两个 view 之间没有细胞身份对应关系，因此无法确认它们是否属于相同或重叠的样本集。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:cell_identity_link"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "MOFA 的官方文档只说明它适用于相同或重叠样本集上的多组学矩阵，没有声明它支持完全无对应关系的独立样本集。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "Given several data matrices with measurements of multiple -omics data types on the same or on overlapping sets of samples, MOFA infers an interpretable low-dimensional representation in terms of a few latent factors ."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "在缺少细胞身份对应关系的情况下，无法判断 RNA 细胞（cohort A）与 ATAC 细胞（cohort B）是否构成 MOFA 所要求的相同或重叠样本集，因此不能确认该用法满足 MOFA 的输入条件。",
      "basis": "MODEL_KNOWLEDGE",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": {
    "question": "两个 view 的样本是否共享任何可识别的细胞或样本 ID，即使 cell_identity_link 当前为 none？",
    "missing_field": "sample_id_overlap",
    "why_needed": "MOFA 的输入要求相同或重叠的样本集；只有确认样本 ID 是否存在重叠，才能判断该用法是否满足 MOFA 的输入条件。"
  }
}
